<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Adaptation Processing</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                
                
               Experience <math id="alg1.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>E</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math>, Schema set <math id="alg1.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math>, Thresholds <math id="alg1.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{\text{meta}},\theta_{\text{elem}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>elem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{\text{meta}},\theta_{\text{elem}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
                
                
               Adaptation path and updated schema set

</div>
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
                
                
               Preprocess <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>E</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E</annotation></semantics></math> into a set of segments <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{e_{1},e_{2},...,e_{k}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{e_{1},e_{2},...,e_{k}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
                
                
               <span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each experience segment <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>e</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="alg1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{e_{1},e_{2},...,e_{k}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{e_{1},e_{2},...,e_{k}\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
                
                
                Find the best matching schema: <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma^{*}\leftarrow\operatorname*{arg\,max}_{\sigma\in S}s_{\text{meta}}(e,\sigma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma^{*}\leftarrow\operatorname*{arg\,max}_{\sigma\in S}s_{\text{meta}}(e,\sigma)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
                
                
                Let <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s^{*}\leftarrow s_{\text{meta}}(e,\sigma^{*})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s^{*}\leftarrow s_{\text{meta}}(e,\sigma^{*})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
                
                
                <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s^{*}\geq\theta_{\text{meta}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>meta</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s^{*}\geq\theta_{\text{meta}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
                
                
                 Find the best matching element: <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{*}\leftarrow\operatorname*{arg\,max}_{u\in U(\sigma^{*})}\kappa(e,u)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mi>κ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{*}\leftarrow\operatorname*{arg\,max}_{u\in U(\sigma^{*})}\kappa(e,u)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
