<span id="A3.F11.pic1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:29.75em;">
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p">User LLM: I’ve been looking at Tonghuashun’s capital flow data for December 2023, particularly the mid-December period. For example, on Dec 11th there was a massive outflow of RMB 98,900 million but a positive net_flow of RMB 35,700 million, while just two days later Dec 13th saw a net outflow of RMB 14,858 million despite a lower outflow value. What factors might explain these rapid shifts in net flows relative to outflows during this period?”</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A3.F11.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F11.pic1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="135.55" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 435.24 135.55" width="435.24"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.55) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 135.55 L 435.24 135.55 L 435.24 0 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9EBEA;" fill="#F9EBEA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 0 L 0 135.55 L 435.24 135.55 L 435.24 0 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.81 14.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:29.75em;--ltx-fo-height:7.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="111.93" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 109.24)" width="411.66"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
